# In SYN_SENT a RST is acceptable only if it acknowledges our SYN
# (RFC 9293 3.10.7.3); a bare RST is ignored.
# Copyright (C) 2026 The LikeOS Project
0.000 socket c stream
0.000 connect c 8080 = -EINPROGRESS
0.000 > S 0:0(0) win * <mss 1460,sackOK,TS val * ecr 0,nop,wscale *>
0.050 < R 0:0(0) win 0
0.060 state c SYN_SENT
